Package: PNDSIBGE
Type: Package
Title: Downloading, Reading and Analyzing PNDS Microdata - Package in
        Development
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(person("Gabriel", "Assuncao", email =
        "pacotesipd@ibge.gov.br", role = c("aut", "cre")),
        person("Luna", "Hidalgo", email = "pacotesipd@ibge.gov.br",
        role = c("aut")), person("Douglas", "Braga", email =
        "pacotesipd@ibge.gov.br", role = c("ctb")), person("Viviane",
        "Quintaes", email = "pacotesipd@ibge.gov.br", role = c("ctb")))
Description: Provides tools for downloading, reading and analyzing the
        National Survey of Demographic and Health - PNDS, a household
        survey from Brazilian Institute of Geography and Statistics -
        IBGE. The data must be downloaded from the official website
        <https://www.ibge.gov.br/>. Further analysis must be made using
        package 'survey'.
Depends: R (>= 3.2.0)
Imports: dplyr, httr, magrittr, projmgr, RCurl, readr, readxl, survey,
        tibble, timeDate, utils
Suggests: convey, SIPDIBGE, srvyr
